{"abstract":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"ViewModifier"},{"type":"text","text":" to manage an edge case about Liquid Glass configuration of Apple OS and Xcode versions."}],"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/documentation\/MISOComponents\/MISOLegacyLayoutModifier","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/documentation\/MISOComponents"]]},"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"tokens":[{"kind":"attribute","text":"@"},{"kind":"attribute","preciseIdentifier":"s:ScM","text":"MainActor"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"MISOLegacyLayoutModifier"}],"platforms":["macOS"],"languages":["swift"]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"kind":"content","content":[{"type":"heading","text":"Overview","level":2,"anchor":"overview"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"If an app is compiled with Xcode 27 for iOS 27, Liquid Glass is forced by the system and considered as enabled by MISO.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"If an app is compiled with Xcode 26 for iOS 26, the ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"UIDesignRequiresCompatibility"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"type":"text","text":" flag is read and MISO considers wether or not Liquid Glass is enabled."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"If an app is compiled with Xcode 26 for iOS 18 and lower, Liquid Glass is considered as unavailable, disabled."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The edge case is when the OS version is 27, the flag ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"UIDesignRequiresCompatibility"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"text":" stils exists but the app is compiled with Xcode 26.","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"This case is extreme: the system does not force Liquid Glass, the flag is here, and MISO cannot only rely on the OS version."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Thus, this "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/documentation\/MISOComponents\/MISOLegacyLayoutModifier","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"type":"text","text":"  will define an environment value saying any legacy layout things (appearances, selector, divider) must be displayed."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"**You must use this "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"ViewModifier"},{"text":" with care, and only if you are using Xcode 26 and  ","type":"text"},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"UIDesignRequiresCompatibility"}]},{"text":" to YES **.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Prefer build with Xcode 27 without the ","type":"text"},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"UIDesignRequiresCompatibility"}]},{"text":"  flag.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift","code":["  MISOTabBar(selectedTab: ..., count: ...) { ... )","    .modifier(MISOLegacyLayoutModifier())"]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Note: You should use this view modifier in your root view because the flag it defines in deeper levels is used for all navigations components like bars"}]}]},{"type":"aside","name":"Since","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"OUDS 3.0.0"}]}],"style":"note"}]}],"kind":"symbol","topicSections":[{"generated":true,"identifiers":["doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/documentation\/MISOComponents\/MISOLegacyLayoutModifier\/init()"],"anchor":"Initializers","title":"Initializers"},{"generated":true,"identifiers":["doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/documentation\/MISOComponents\/MISOLegacyLayoutModifier\/body(content:)"],"anchor":"Instance-Methods","title":"Instance Methods"},{"generated":true,"identifiers":["doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/documentation\/MISOComponents\/MISOLegacyLayoutModifier\/ViewModifier-Implementations"],"anchor":"Default-Implementations","title":"Default Implementations"}],"sch